#. help text package status
#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:790
msgid ""
"<b>Update Problem List</b><br><p>The packages in the list cannot be updated "
"automatically.</p><p>Possible reasons:</p><p>They are obsoleted by other "
"packages.</p><p>There is no newer version to which to update on any "
"installation media.</p><p>They are third-party packages</p><p>Manually "
"select what to do with them. The safest course of action is to delete them.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>ລາຍການບັນຫາການອັບເດດ</b><br><p>ແພັກເກດໃນລາຍການບໍ່ສາມາດອັບເດດໄດ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ.</"
"p><p>ເຫດຜົນທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້:</p><p>ພວກມັນຖືກແທນທີ່ໂດຍແພັກເກດອື່ນແລ້ວ.</"
"p><p>ບໍ່ມີລຸ້ນໃໝ່ກວ່າໃນສື່ການຕິດຕັ້ງໃດໆ.</p><p>ພວກມັນແມ່ນແພັກເກດຈາກພາກສ່ວນທີສາມ.</"
"p><p>ກະລຸນາເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບພວກມັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ. ວິທີທີ່ປອດໄພທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນການລຶບພວກມັນອອກ.</p>"

#. column header source RPM installation (keep it short!)
#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:797
msgid "Source"
msgstr "ຕົ້ນສະບັບ"

#. part of the patch description
#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:804
msgid "<b>Patch: </b>"
msgstr "<b>ແພັດ: </b>"

#. info line is shown if YOU patch list is empty
#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:811
msgid "No patches available"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແພັດໃຫ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:817
msgid "Script"
msgstr "ສະຄຣິບ"

#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:823
msgid "Incompatible Package Versions"
msgstr "ລຸ້ນຂອງແພັກເກດບໍ່ເຂົ້າກັນ"

#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:830
msgid ""
"<p>You are trying to install multiversion-capable and non-multiversion-"
"capable versions of this package at the same time.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທ່ານກຳລັງພະຍາຍາມຕິດຕັ້ງລຸ້ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍລຸ້ນ (multiversion) ແລະ "
"ລຸ້ນທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍລຸ້ນຂອງແພັກເກດນີ້ໃນເວລາດຽວກັນ.</p>"

#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:839
msgid ""
"<p>This version is multiversion-capable.</p><p>Press \"Continue\" to install "
"this version and unselect the non-multiversion-capable version, \"Cancel\" "
"to unselect this version and keep the other one.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເວີຊັນນີ້ສາມາດຮອງຮັບໄດ້ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນ.</p><p>ກົດ \"ຕໍ່ໄປ\" ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເວີຊັນນີ້ ແລະ "
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກເວີຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດຮອງຮັບໄດ້ຫຼາຍເວີຊັນ, \"ຍົກເລີກ\" ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເລືອກເວີຊັນນີ້ ແລະ "
"ຮັກສາເວີຊັນອື່ນໄວ້.</p>"

#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:849
msgid ""
"<p>This version is not multiversion-capable.</p><p>Press \"Continue\" to "
"install only this version and unselect all other versions, \"Cancel\" to "
"unselect this version and keep the other ones.<p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ລຸ້ນນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍລຸ້ນ. ກົດ \"ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່\" ເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະລຸ້ນນີ້ ແລະ "
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລຸ້ນອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ, ຫຼື ກົດ \"ຍົກເລີກ\" ເພື່ອຍົກເລີກການເລືອກລຸ້ນນີ້ ແລະ ຮັກສາລຸ້ນອື່ນໆໄວ້.<p>"

#. Special status for versions of a package that are retracted, i.e. that
#. were released, but it was later realized that a broken version was
#. published that should rather not be used. This is a very exceptional
#. case that requires special attention by the user.
#: src/NCPkgStrings.cc:862
msgid "[RETRACTED]"
msgstr "[ຖືກຖອນຄືນ]"

#. Headline of confirmation popup
#: src/NCPkgTable.cc:1200
msgid "Please confirm"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາຢືນຢັນ"

#. %s is a package name
#: src/NCPkgTable.cc:1204
#, c-format
msgid "<p>Really install a retracted version of \"%s\" ?</p>"
msgstr "<p>ຕ້ອງການຕິດຕັ້ງລຸ້ນທີ່ຖືກຖອນຄືນຂອງ \"%s\" ແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?</p>"
